  "privacyPolicyHtml": "<style>\n    .pp-section { margin-bottom: 25px; }\n    .pp-date { color: #666; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n    h2 { \n        color: #16213e; \n        font-size: 19px; \n        margin-top: 25px; \n        margin-bottom: 12px; \n        border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n        padding-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    h3 { color: #0f3460; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    p { margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: left; }\n    ul { margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; }\n    li { margin-bottom: 6px; }\n    .highlight-box {\n        background: #f0f7ff;\n        padding: 15px;\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;\n        margin: 20px 0;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .contact-box {\n        background: #f8fafc;\n        padding: 15px;\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n        margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h1>Privacy Policy<\/h1>\n    <p class=\"pp-date\">Last updated: August 17, 2026<\/p>\n    \n    <p>Welcome to <strong>geradoAI<\/strong>. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>1. Information We Collect<\/h2>\n    <p>geradoAI may collect certain information to provide you with the best possible experience. The types of information we may collect include:<\/p>\n    <ul><li><strong>Device Information:<\/strong> Device type, operating system version, and unique device identifiers<\/li><li><strong>Usage Data:<\/strong> App usage statistics and interaction patterns<\/li><li><strong>Location Data:<\/strong> Geographic location when permitted by you<\/li><\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>2. Permissions<\/h2>\n    <p>Our app may request the following permissions to provide its features:<\/p>\n    \n            <h3>📍 Location<\/h3>\n            <p>Location access may be used to provide location-based services or content personalization when requested by web content.<\/p>\n        \n            <h3>📁 Storage<\/h3>\n            <p>Storage permission is used to save files, images, or downloads from the app to your device.<\/p>\n        \n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information<\/h2>\n    <p>We use the information we collect to:<\/p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Provide and maintain our service<\/li>\n        <li>Improve user experience and app functionality<\/li>\n        <li>Display relevant advertisements (if applicable)<\/li>\n        <li>Send push notifications (if enabled)<\/li>\n        <li>Respond to customer support requests<\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>4. Third-Party Services<\/h2>\n    <p>Our app may use third-party services that collect information used to identify you. These may include:<\/p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        \n        <li><strong>Google Play Services<\/strong><\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>5. Data Security<\/h2>\n    <p>We value your trust in providing us your personal information, thus we strive to use commercially acceptable means of protecting it. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee its absolute security.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>6. Children's Privacy<\/h2>\n    <p>Our app does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13. If we discover that a child under 13 has provided us with personal information, we immediately delete this from our servers.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>7. Your Rights<\/h2>\n    <p>Depending on your location, you may have certain rights regarding your personal data, including the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your data.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy<\/h2>\n    <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pp-section\">\n    <h2>9. Contact Us<\/h2>\n    <div class=\"contact-box\">\n        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:<\/p>\n        \n        \n        <p>Through the app's contact feature.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"highlight-box\">\n    <strong>By using geradoAI, you agree to this Privacy Policy.<\/strong>\n<\/div>",
